Construct a coherent metal-production, use-quality, and recovery study across the whole chain (@metal-integrated-project: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @metals-and-metallurgical-production, #source "../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB", #source "../sources/Iron-and-Steel-Production-BREF.lingua#r_1R9HC6SENF991ZZQA5WKH2C8HD", #source "../sources/Aluminium-Automotive-Manual.lingua#r_73MPKA19MDBSQ96195B818Z49T", #source "../sources/Metal-Recycling-UNEP-IRP.lingua#r_40JXFY43ST442BB8MJEAYJT9N1", #source "../sources/Metals-Alloys-and-Graduate-Teaching-Bhadeshia.lingua#r_0HZJKN8WC6SEWA0DABM8P4HC3F", #source "../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ", #metals-and-metallurgical-production "Independent-metallurgical-scholarship-and-new-evidence.lingua#r_631TWRB9DJYJVCFP74GBBAYQ9S") { r_23EJ948P4NHVC4SFAK06ERMSGF
**Read:** [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), whole relevant metal-family and shared technical accounts; [Iron and Steel Production — European Commission BREF](../sources/Iron-and-Steel-Production-BREF.lingua#r_1R9HC6SENF991ZZQA5WKH2C8HD), the complete document for an iron/steel system; [Aluminium Automotive Manual — European Aluminium and collaborators](../sources/Aluminium-Automotive-Manual.lingua#r_73MPKA19MDBSQ96195B818Z49T), complete relevant product/function and manufacturing cases; [Metal Recycling: Opportunities, Limits, Infrastructure — UNEP International Resource Panel](../sources/Metal-Recycling-UNEP-IRP.lingua#r_40JXFY43ST442BB8MJEAYJT9N1), the whole report; [Metals, alloys, steels, and graduate modeling — Bhadeshia teaching materials](../sources/Metals-Alloys-and-Graduate-Teaching-Bhadeshia.lingua#r_0HZJKN8WC6SEWA0DABM8P4HC3F), all complete relevant theory/graduate material; [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ), reuse independent validation, preservation, and reproducibility.

Choose a material function and a documented feed-to-qualified-product system. Integrate characterization/custody, extraction/refining, phase/impurity control, thermal/mechanical/fabrication history, testing/inspection, utilities, equipment/maintenance, people, residuals, use/repair, and recovery. Reuse prior studies and shared Records with compatible assumptions rather than silently changing boundaries at each interface.

Develop a baseline and two substantive alternatives on the same useful product/function. Preserve conserved elements, water/charge/energy where applicable, inventories, time, capacity/availability, property distributions, reference states, data/model versions, and uncertainty. Check that intermediate specifications actually satisfy the receiving process and that final test evidence supports the claimed product population.

Test changed feed/impurities, a consequential utility/equipment interruption, and a different service/recovery condition. Follow effects across boundaries instead of holding every downstream step ideal. Compare useful output, material/energy/water/reagent needs, recovery, exposure/residuals, maintenance, restoration, and knowledge transfer.

**Work:** deliver a substantial technical/research-style study with complete primary bibliography, derivations, original inspectable calculations, independent checks, observations, alternatives, and defended conclusions. Have another reader reproduce a central result and challenge the weakest consequential assumption. Revise from evidence and retain disagreements. Explain which laboratory, field, and operating achievements were actually demonstrated and which further specialist infrastructure/knowledge is needed next.

**Continue:** [Investigate an unresolved metallurgical question with independent and challengeable evidence](Independent-metallurgical-scholarship-and-new-evidence.lingua#r_631TWRB9DJYJVCFP74GBBAYQ9S).

**Return:** [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1).
